{
  "name": "Stridewell",
  "category": "Business dashboards",
  "kind": "template",
  "summary": "A dashboard for a chain of fitness studios with a live studio floor and heart-rate zones",
  "about": "A nine-page dashboard for three fitness studios, drawn near-black with hot coral and lime (or chalk paper in the light theme). The Today page shows a floor plan where every spot is a dot: a lime runner walks from the entrance to its room each time someone checks in, while the class in progress streams heart-rate zones. Schedule, class rosters with a waitlist, members, trainers, check-ins, memberships, retention and settings all work.",
  "how": [
    "Watch the studio floor on Today: rooms fill with dots as members check in, and the open gym drifts",
    "Open the live class to see each person's heart-rate zone, promote people from the waitlist or check them in",
    "Switch studios from the header, then filter the week schedule by discipline or trainer and add a class",
    "Search members, open a profile drawer, book them into a class, pause or edit them",
    "Check someone in at the front desk, follow up no-shows and retry failed payments",
    "Compare retention by plan and nudge members who have gone quiet",
    "Press Ctrl+K to jump anywhere; change booking rules or reset demo data in Settings"
  ],
